### Keep cleanup failures from interrupting event delivery

**Severity:** `medium`

The disconnected-handler callback is invoked from inside the exception branch without its own isolation. If lifecycle cleanup throws, that exception escapes `Raise` and prevents later healthy subscribers from receiving the notification, recreating the failure mode this helper is intended to eliminate. Contain cleanup failures independently and add a regression test with a throwing unsubscribe callback.

```suggestion
                try
                {
                    unsubscribe?.Invoke(handler);
                }
                catch
                {
                    // Cleanup must not prevent delivery to the remaining subscribers.
                }
```
